<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 800 million.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 800 million.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 800 million pounds for auction on July 7 and issue on July 8 when 182-day bills worth 800.550 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.958 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 pounds)</p>
</text>
